• connecting traffic hubs/terminals (airports, seaports) with the final destination;
• high-speed & metro transport within populated areas;
• city-to-city transport by high-speed or conventional trains (domestic/international);
• local trains at peak demand to the city-centre station;
• use of outdated/less-loaded railways for tourist purposes;
• OCCASIONAL transport (excursion, party, Christmas trains);
